icked to sin."],"ref":"Proverbs 10:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"¶The labour","strong":"H6468"},{"text":" of the righteous","strong":"H6662"},{"text":" [tendeth] to life","strong":"H2416"},{"text":": the fruit","strong":"H8393"},{"text":" of the wicked","strong":"H7563"},{"text":" to sin","strong":"H2403"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16673,"title":"Proverbs 10:17","segments":["¶He [is in] the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth. {erreth: or, causeth to err}"],"ref":"Proverbs 10:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"¶He [is in] the way","strong":"H734"},{"text":" of life","strong":"H2416"},{"text":" that keepeth","strong":"H8104"},{"text":" instruction","strong":"H4148"},{"text":": but he that refuseth","strong":"H5800"},{"text":" reproof","strong":"H8433"},{"text":" erreth","strong":"H8582"},{"text":". {erreth: or, causeth to err}"}]},{"id":16674,"title":"Proverbs 10:18","segments":["¶He that hideth hatred [with] lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, [is] a fool."],"ref":"Proverbs 10:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"¶He that hideth","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" hatred","strong":"H8135"},{"text":" [with] lying","strong":"H8267"},{"text":" lips","strong":"H8193"},{"text":", and he that uttereth","strong":"H3318"},{"text":" a slander","strong":"H1681"},{"text":", [is] a fool","strong":"H3684"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16675,"title":"Proverbs 10:19","segments":["¶In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips [is] wise."],"ref":"Proverbs 10:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"¶In the multitude","strong":"H7230"},{"text":" of words","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" there wanteth","strong":"H2308"},{"text":" not sin","strong":"H6588"},{"text":": but he that refraineth","strong":"H2820"},{"text":" his lips","strong":"H8193"},{"text":" [is] wise","strong":"H7919"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":16676,"title":"Proverbs 10:20","segments":["¶The tongue of the just [is as] choice silver: the heart of the wicked [is] little worth."],