","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" what is acceptable","strong":"H7522"},{"text":": but the mouth","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of the wicked","strong":"H7563"},{"text":" [speaketh] frowardness","strong":"H8419"},{"text":". {frowardness: Heb. frowardnesses}"}]}]}
